  "features": [
    "Providers entry explicitly refreshes the fixed Models.dev endpoint; cached snapshot remains usable and is labeled with its original timestamp. Duplicate in-flight refresh requests are coalesced.",
    "Actual catalog provider records, including zero-model providers; provider search; only that provider models; original ID search and advisory Tools/Structured output/Reasoning/Image input filters; Back retains search/provider context.",
    "Six reviewed official logos bundled as passive local assets; initials for others. Catalog never supplies executable packages, endpoints or image URLs.",
    "Separate original providerId/modelId, identifier-only IPC, exact Main catalog membership and trusted adapter/text-modality/runtime-ID validation. Unsupported entries browse without execution.",
    "Existing Main-owned Windows secure credential storage retained; real save/replace/remove/restart and no stored-key disclosure observed.",
    "One basic authenticated invocation (20 seconds, 512 output token cap), then a separate real challenge/tool-result round trip (at most two calls, 30 seconds, 1024 output tokens per call); no automatic retries, telemetry or raw SDK warnings.",
    "Both matching five-minute Main-owned attestations bind to credential revision. Metadata/basic success alone cannot produce Ready. Inconclusive tools remain unverified. Fresh results are reused and revoked on key/model/dismissal/restart changes.",
    "Existing eight-check localhost wizard, explicit per-audit consent, draft persistence and typed future handoff preserved. No audit session/activity is fabricated."
  ],
